  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2925bd0c6a5ea9a4fbbc9ab434791dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Disease_TomatoEarlyBlight
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  diseaseId: early_blight
  diseaseName: Early Blight
  aiLabelAliases:
  - Tomato___Early_blight
  - tomato_early_blight
  - tomato early blight
  - Tomato Early blight leaf
  pathogenType: 0
  pathogen: 
  affectedPart: 0
  sources: []
  description: A common fungal leaf disease of tomato and potato caused by Alternaria
    species.
  causes: Warm, humid conditions with extended leaf wetness; inoculum surviving on
    crop residue and soil.
  effectOnPlant: Lesions destroy photosynthetic tissue and cause leaves to yellow
    and drop, weakening the plant.
  untreatedOutcome: Severe defoliation can expose fruit to sunscald and substantially
    reduce yield.
  symptoms:
  - Dark spots with concentric rings
  - Yellow halo around lesions
  - Lower/older leaves affected first
  - Progressive defoliation
  supportingFeatureIds:
  - leaf_spots
  - yellowing
  - leaf_color
  moderateSeverityThreshold: 0.35
  severeSeverityThreshold: 0.7
  treatmentPlan: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3599a079963a30f498b68448c124ae96, type: 2}
  preventionPlan: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5ca0afc8658d0d344bf3a40d99d647c2, type: 2}
  simulationProfile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e85f7aaecec23be4fbf23458223c25dc, type: 2}
  lifecycleStages:
  - Spores survive on crop debris and in the soil between seasons.
  - Wind and splashing water carry them to the lower, older leaves.
  - Dark spots with rings and yellow halos appear within days in warm, damp weather.
  - Spots join, leaves yellow and drop, and new spores spread to nearby plants.
  conditionFactors:
  - "Warm days, roughly 24\u201329 \xB0C, with humid nights."
  - Leaves staying wet from dew, rain or overhead watering.
  - Older or stressed plants, especially those short of nitrogen.
  - Plants close together, or infected debris left on the ground.
  referencePhotos:
  - {fileID: 2800000, guid: 29686357ddfbc1c4db6421456db4291a, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 2800000, guid: b46d51fbfe07b3c4da39da023748d0de, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 2800000, guid: e484e6845b1bcfb4197cba1bb01c21f3, type: 3}
  lesionLabel: Ringed lesion
  haloLabel: Yellow halo
  areaLabel: Yellowing leaf
